  "original_summary": "\r\n1. Inputs and outputs of the method:\r\n- The method takes a String parameter named \"property\" and returns a HashSet of Strings.\r\n\r\n2. Business purpose:\r\n- The method is used to create a HashSet of Strings from a given property.\r\n\r\n3. Detailed functional summary of the method:\r\n- The method first initializes an empty HashSet named \"properties\".\r\n- It then checks if the \"property\" is not null and not equal to \"null\".\r\n- If the condition is met, it uses a regular expression pattern \"([\\\\w]+)[;]*\" to match and extract the individual property values from the \"property\" string.\r\n- The extracted property values are added to the \"properties\" HashSet.\r\n- Finally, the method returns the populated HashSet of property values.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
